  "contentHtml": "<p>요즘 AI와 여러 편리한 수업 도구들을 많이 사용하셔서 이용중이신분도 많으실텐데</p><p>인터랙티브 사용해보니 편리하고 여러 재미난 수업용 게임 툴들이 많아서&#160; 혹시나 하고 공유해봅니다^^&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>2학년 5단원 정리하면서 사용했는데 생각보다 아이들 반응이 좋네요^^</p><p>아이들이 직관적이면서 정리에 도움이 되었다고 합니다^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://interacty.me/projects/fb055b3d74b267d2\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">인터랙티브 - 매력적인 콘텐츠 | Interacty project</a></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"인터랙티브 - 매력적인 콘텐츠\" data-og-description=\"직접 체험해 보세요!\" data-og-host=\"interacty.me\" data-og-source-url=\"https://interacty.me/projects/fb055b3d74b267d2\" data-og-url=\"https://interacty.me/projects/fb055b3d74b267d2\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bw1SOx/hyZJiNipxF/iRfrAZQhGcddLMKpezjHF0/img.png?width=600&amp;height=448&amp;face=0_0_600_448\"><a href=\"https://interacty.me/projects/fb055b3d74b267d2\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://interacty.me/projects/fb055b3d74b267d2\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bw1SOx/hyZJiNipxF/iRfrAZQhGcddLMKpezjHF0/img.png?width=600&amp;height=448&amp;face=0_0_600_448\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">인터랙티브 - 매력적인 콘텐츠</p><p class=\"og-desc\">직접 체험해 보세요!</p><p class=\"og-host\">interacty.me</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec3fc0036f0e44b41719cf6cadec6e93e9dbbbfe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ec3fc0036f0e44b41719cf6cadec6e93e9dbbbfe\" data-origin-width=\"1190\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
